WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.446 --> 00:00:09.104
Breaking news: a private Learjet 60 has crashed in Greenacres, Palm Beach County, Florida, on a flight from Austin, Texas, to the Bahamas.

2
00:00:10.446 --> 00:00:15.469
At thirty-five thousand feet, pilots reported turbulence, icing, and precipitation.

3
00:00:16.264 --> 00:00:23.440
The jet then entered a rapid dive, falling between ten thousand and thirty thousand feet per minute, as the pilot declared a mayday emergency.

4
00:00:25.396 --> 00:00:29.933
All nine people on board were killed, Transportation Secretary Sean Duffy confirmed.

5
00:00:30.728 --> 00:00:34.571
Governor Ron DeSantis said there were no immediate reports of ground injuries.

6
00:00:35.346 --> 00:00:37.754
The jet erupted into a fireball by the road.

7
00:00:38.549 --> 00:00:43.815
About six hundred residents were evacuated, and the FAA and NTSB are investigating.
